+                "Review one stored expression candidate against the authoritative character core below. "
+                "Classify semantic function; interaction stance or claims are never expressive style. "
+                "Return JSON only: {candidate_kind: expressive_style|interaction_stance|reported_fact|unknown, "
+                "compatibility_status: compatible|incompatible}. Compatible means the expression can be used "
+                "without teaching contempt, coercion, entitlement, blame, or denial of another person's feelings. "
